    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:34:53 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- Moving Nabız to Applications now finishes the new copy before replacing the old one, so a failed move can never leave Applications without Nabız.
- The app on the disk image no longer carries a leftover Finder flag.

Signed with Developer ID and notarized by Apple. Updates arrive through Sparkle.
]]></description>
