    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:34:53 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- Nabız now comes as a disk image: open it and drag Nabız to Applications.
- Opened straight from the disk image or the Downloads folder, Nabız offers to move itself to Applications, so it keeps opening at login.
- Opening at login is now set up from the copy in Applications, not from wherever Nabız first ran.

Signed with Developer ID and notarized by Apple. Updates arrive through Sparkle.
]]></description>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/alicinaroglu/nabiz/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
